 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "participants is a list of [name, country, availableDates] rows, where availableDates lists \"YYYY-MM-DD\" strings (a date repeated in one participant's list counts once). For each country choose the date on which the most of its participants are available, ties to the earliest date. Return [country, date, attendees] for every country with at least one available date, sorted by country in code-point order, where attendees are the names of that country's participants available on the chosen date, in input order. Countries whose participants list no dates get no meeting and are omitted.",
